        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ron Johnson\n- Organizations: Monterey Peninsula College, California State University system\n- Places: California State University, Long Beach, California\n- Topics: University enrollment, University naming\n\nFacts:\n- Ron Johnson first enrolled at Monterey Peninsula College before transferring to California State University, Long Beach.\n- California State University, Long Beach is also known as CSULB, Long Beach State, Cal State Long Beach, LBSU, and The Beach.\n- California State University, Long Beach is the third largest campus in the 23-school California State University system.\n- In Fall 2016, California State University, Long Beach had 37,776 students enrolled.\n- California State University, Long Beach is one of the largest universities in California by enrollment.",
